  "body": "Fast. Play only during your turn and if you spent 5 or more resources this round.\nSearch the top X cards of your deck for a card, where X is the number of resources spent this round, and add it to your hand. Shuffle your deck. Then, repeat this process two more times. You may immediately play 1 of the 3 cards added to your hand this way (<i>paying its cost</i>). Remove Flash of Wealth from the game.",
